      "text": "<h1 id=\"jelastic-cs-correspondence\">Jelastic & CS Correspondence</h1>\n\nThe table below displays dependencies between Cloud Scripting and the Jelastic Platform versions within the same <a href=\"https://jelastic.cloud/\" target=\"_blank\">hosting provider</a> platform.\n\n{% if config.extra.all_versions %}\n    {% if config.extra.all_jel_versions %}\n\n        <table class=\"corresp\" style=\"width:100%\">\n            <tr id=\"cs\">\n                <th id=\"table-head\">CS</th>\n                    {% for version in config.extra.all_versions %}\n                        <td>{{ version }}</td>\n                    {% endfor %}\n            </tr>\n            <tr id=\"jel\">\n                <th id=\"table-head\">Jelastic</th>\n                {% for version in config.extra.all_jel_versions %}\n                    <td>{{ version }}</td>\n                {% endfor %}\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n\n    {% endif %}\n{% endif %}",
